      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Лавров, у нас рук не хватает.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lavrov, we are short-handed here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Я тебя на заготовку отправил.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I sent you to do the vegetable prep.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Прости, я просто Вику в травмпункт возил.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry, I was just taking Vika to the emergency clinic.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ну, что делать собираешься?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So, what are you planning to do now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "denis",
      "t": "Устроюсь куда-нибудь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will get a job somewhere.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "denis",
      "t": "Ну, хоть на стройку пойду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, I will even go work at a construction site.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "denis",
      "t": "Денёк выдался.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a day this turned out to be.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Не надо на стройку.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You do not need to go to a construction site.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Здесь будешь работать. Поваром.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You will work right here. As a cook.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "denis",
      "t": "Макс, ты что, я же готовить не умею.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Max, what do you mean, I don't know how to cook.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Тебе не надо будет готовить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You will not need to cook.'",
      "gap": 0.45
